Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-Sixth Episode\NThe Butterfly Witch
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,At this pace, it won't take\Nlong to get to Goldland!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.38,0:02:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon we'll be in sight\Nof my castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.42,0:02:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.78,0:02:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens! Did you see,\NFranz? There's a fire in the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.02,0:02:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what could have happened..!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.06,0:02:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I must go and see immediately.\NI hope it's not serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.06,0:02:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There will be chaos in the city, so you\Ngo to the castle and wait for me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.74,0:02:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But Franz, if I came with you, I\Ncould be of help to you, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.30,0:02:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I alone will be enough\Nto organize the firefighting efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.74,0:02:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't follow me!\NUnderstood? See you later! Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.06,0:02:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd really like to help\Nhim, but he won't let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.74,0:02:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet I must find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.14,0:02:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an idea! I'll follow\Nhim, but in another guise!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.50,0:02:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look around,\NOpal! Do you see anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.50,0:02:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.22,0:03:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help!\N- Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.78,0:03:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- There's a fire!\N- It's horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.06,0:03:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Quick, let's run away!\N- Help! Let's run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.22,0:03:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Water! Throw the water!\N- Water! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.94,0:03:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Quick! Quick!\N- Fast! Fast! Fast! Fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.58,0:03:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire will spread\Nthrough the whole city!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.86,0:03:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's run! The mysterious\Nknight has set a fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.06,0:03:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It was really him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.54,0:03:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- I saw him too!\N- Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.26,0:03:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- He himself!\N- Yes, he set the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.10,0:03:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, really him!\N- What?! The mysterious knight...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.14,0:03:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...set the fire?\N- They say it was him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.54,0:03:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's incredible!\NYou can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.90,0:03:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How could such a big\Nfire have been possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.82,0:03:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz, they saw\Nthe mysterious knight...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.62,0:03:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...setting the fire!\N- The mysterious knight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.30,0:03:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's run, before everything\Ncollapses! Save yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.74,0:04:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We must contain the flames! Let's\Nrun, before everything collapses!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.26,0:04:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz! Let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.14,0:04:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the mysterious knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.18,0:04:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, mysterious knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.42,0:04:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I must follow him\Neven through the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.54,0:04:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help!\N- Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.54,0:04:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help! Help!\N- It's a little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.50,0:04:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're safe, dear! Don't\Nworry, everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.38,0:04:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mysterious knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you return to the\Nscene of your wicked deed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.06,0:04:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do you mean?\N- Are you playing dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.06,0:04:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We know that you set the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.10,0:04:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- What? I set the fire?! But that's a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Damn it, stop pretending!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.34,0:05:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- One moment! There\Nmust be a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.50,0:05:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- This is no time to argue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.54,0:05:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, I am arresting you, and then\Nyou can clear your name before the judges!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wait! First of all, we must\Nget this little girl to safety...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.94,0:05:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Enough talk! Get off your horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.02,0:05:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's put our differences aside for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now we need to save\Nourselves, we're in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Fine, as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.66,0:05:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We must get this little girl\Nout of here immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.54,0:05:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, I'll take care of her. Poor\Nthing, she fainted from the shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.86,0:05:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Prince Franz, we will\Ndiscuss the matter later!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.38,0:05:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Scoundrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- I hear noises in the chimney...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.34,0:06:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's my little ones.\N- Well, well! I see my dear little girls have come home!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.30,0:06:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, I want to reward\Nyou with the best food.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.74,0:06:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come! Come, dears!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.14,0:06:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There's honey soup! Eat!\N- Go ahead and eat, my little ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.46,0:06:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.78,0:06:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The mysterious knight who\Nset fire to the city of Goldland!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.58,0:06:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouths, you fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.22,0:06:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If they find out\Nwhat I made you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.58,0:06:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll turn you into bats!\NIs that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.94,0:06:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But you were the one who told us\Nto shout from the rooftops that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.34,0:06:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,..The mysterious knight\Nset the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.26,0:06:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You were supposed to shout that in the city,\Nbut here you speak in low voices!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.62,0:06:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Go on, speak!\N- Everything went very well,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- we set the fire.\N- Why are you speaking in low voices?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.42,0:06:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But you told us\Nto speak in low voices!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:07:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it, you damned idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.66,0:07:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz is convinced that it was\Nthe mysterious knight...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,..who set the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.90,0:07:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.46,0:07:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you can even give us\Nsomething to eat as a reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.06,0:07:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- We've gotten hungry!\N- First make sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.14,0:07:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,...that the plan is going\Nperfectly smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.34,0:07:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Then I'm not doing this anymore!\N- And I hate these clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.22,0:07:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't obey me, I'll throw\Nmy butterfly food all over you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.06,0:07:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't like it if my friends\Nfound you tasty, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.98,0:07:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, definitely not! I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We will do everything you ask us to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.46,0:07:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- But don't let the butterflies eat us!\N- Please! I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.94,0:07:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine! Then I will send\Nyou to the dream world!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There, go into the wonderful dream world!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.82,0:07:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the magic sphere! It will\Ngive you strength and courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.26,0:07:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen now to what I command you to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.06,0:08:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You will go to the castle of Goldland...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.46,0:08:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and you will take the Prince's sword,\Nwhich is in Franz's room,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,to stir up his hatred!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.38,0:08:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Get a move on\Nand get moving, you slackers!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.02,0:08:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,At your orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz has created a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.14,0:08:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's best that I clarify\Nthings, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.82,0:09:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- The sword case! There it is!\N- Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.42,0:09:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you see that nearby\Nthere's a guard? Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.78,0:09:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We must act with the utmost\Ncaution! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.26,0:09:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!\NBut this is just a suit of armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.54,0:09:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who goes there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.06,0:09:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I heard a noise\Ncoming from the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.82,0:09:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's just a cat and a mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.38,0:09:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.58,0:09:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If we take this to the witch,\Nshe will be very grateful to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.94,0:09:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this time she'll feed us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.10,0:10:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.26,0:10:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The Prince's sword is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.74,0:10:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'm taking this sword!\NSigned: the mysterious knight"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.62,0:10:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Damnation!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.66,0:10:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a thief and a coward,\Nmysterious knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.50,0:10:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't end here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.42,0:10:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who is it?\N- It's me, Franz! It's Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.74,0:10:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You came to the castle, Sapphire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.26,0:10:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Hi, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.14,0:10:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I told you not to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.38,0:10:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was worried about you and the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- What happened?\N- It’s hard to believe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.98,0:10:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That cursed ghost knight set fire to the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.78,0:10:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,putting the lives of its inhabitants in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.10,0:10:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Not content with that, he stole the Prince's famous sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It couldn't have been him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.42,0:11:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't believe it, huh? At first\NI didn't want to believe it either,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.74,0:11:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but then I saw him with my own eyes\Nrunning through the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.46,0:11:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I have clear proof here:\Nthis note!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.78,0:11:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- Read it!\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.82,0:11:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange...! Who could have\Never done such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.30,0:11:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you won't keep believing\Nthat it wasn't him, I hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.10,0:11:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I think it could be\Na plan organized by...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.06,0:11:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are very naive. Shut up,\NI'll take care of this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.06,0:11:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- But Franz..!\N- I don't want to hear anything
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.50,0:11:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please, go home!\N- As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.62,0:11:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, we'll see each other again\Nwhen you've cleared your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.26,0:11:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.02,0:11:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I made him angry,\Nbut I didn't mean to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Franz.\NI'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess is approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.94,0:12:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She won't be able to save herself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.02,0:12:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Opale! Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.82,0:12:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Damnation! That bitch\Nis killing my little creatures!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.22,0:12:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I must stop her\Nand teach her a good lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.14,0:12:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Go into the world of dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.14,0:12:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That light...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.26,0:13:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You sleep such a strange sleep\Nthat it can no longer be called human!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.02,0:13:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is spinning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.14,0:13:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I'm sorry for how\NI behaved the other night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,An arrow! With a letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.34,0:13:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,"I await you at the edge\Nof the forest for a challenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.70,0:13:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,today, at sunset.\NSigned: the mysterious knight"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.82,0:13:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are a brazen one,\Nmysterious knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.86,0:13:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell am I?\NWhat am I doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I've got it! This is the base\Nof the false mysterious knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.74,0:14:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.78,0:14:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm starving!\N- Finally we can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.58,0:14:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not yet!\NGo to the swamp in the forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.86,0:14:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and gather a basket\Nfull of algae!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.38,0:14:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.18,0:14:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?\NWhat are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.06,0:14:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- We're too hungry...\N- To make even the slightest move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.94,0:14:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll stick some\Nof my butterfly mush on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:14:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! Forget it!\NLet's go right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.90,0:15:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, the Princess\Nis sleeping soundly
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.02,0:15:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now she will wear the clothes\Nof the mysterious knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.90,0:15:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The spell\Nwasn't strong enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.22,0:15:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you send a fake mysterious knight\Nto set fire to the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.10,0:15:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You guessed right!\NBut don't celebrate yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.38,0:15:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,because now I will get rid of you!\NTake this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.58,0:15:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!\NMy trap worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.62,0:15:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Tied up like this,\Nyou won't be able to escape anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll meet Franz in your\Nplace, my dear masked knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.54,0:15:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! No, wait!\NLeave Franz alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.06,0:15:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my dear little creatures,\Ncome and have fun with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.18,0:15:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.82,0:16:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Cursed witch!\NShe has another evil plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.02,0:16:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I must try to warn\NFranz immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.62,0:16:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! Franz, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.62,0:16:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve been here for an hour\Nand no one is showing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.66,0:16:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.22,0:16:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look at my light that\Nleads you through dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.10,0:16:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And who are you? What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.18,0:17:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The mysterious knight will\Nnot come here, Prince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.78,0:17:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you will fall asleep\Nand go to him in a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.10,0:17:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is spinning..
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.06,0:17:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gush from the depths of the earth,\Nevil fluid!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.46,0:17:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Send sparks and flames\Nthrough the sky, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.98,0:17:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, my dear children, dance\Nand celebrate the end of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.70,0:17:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My handsome little Prince, I command you\Nto go to the mill, in the forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.94,0:17:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and to kill\Nthe mysterious knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.70,0:17:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I will kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.46,0:17:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.90,0:18:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that you cannot\Nescape that witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.18,0:18:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter how hard you try?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.22,0:18:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- She is a horrible\Nand terrible old woman! - How stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.54,0:18:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You two really are fools\Nto let yourselves be treated like dogs...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.58,0:18:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...by an old witch\Nlike that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.02,0:18:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, we have tried\Nto escape many times!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.26,0:18:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But every time she\Ncast a spell on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.06,0:18:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's join forces,\Nso we can destroy her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.58,0:18:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.22,0:18:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you untie me, when she arrives\NI will try to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.86,0:18:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,While I fight her,\Nyou can escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.90,0:18:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do you say? Are you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.90,0:18:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Of course I want to! I accept!\N- I accept too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.34,0:18:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The witch is already back! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.74,0:18:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How unlucky I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.18,0:18:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.38,0:18:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, the mysterious\Nknight is in front of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.06,0:19:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember how much he made you\Nsuffer! Come on, tear him to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.34,0:19:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned mysterious knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.58,0:19:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.42,0:19:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, I'm sorry! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.86,0:19:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, why are you here? What\Nare you doing in front of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.22,0:19:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, a moment ago you tried to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.02,0:19:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- What? Kill you?!\N- It's her fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.98,0:19:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She cast a spell on us\Nand made it so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.66,0:19:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...that a fake mysterious knight\Nwould torment you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.66,0:19:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Take this!\N- Franz, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.30,0:19:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.02,0:20:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you ugly witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.26,0:20:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.22,0:20:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the ceiling is lowering!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.54,0:20:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Franz!\NThe door won't open!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.62,0:20:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That cursed woman\Nhas put us in a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.46,0:20:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you know well\Nwhat happens to those who go..
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.38,0:20:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...against the famous witch of the\Nbutterflies of Union X, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.50,0:21:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn! Another trap\Nfrom Union X!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.22,0:21:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished! Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.34,0:21:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse it!\NDamn them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.22,0:21:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let the ceiling fall\Non them! I'll crush them like worms!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.58,0:21:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- We have to get out! Quick!\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.38,0:21:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.70,0:21:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.94,0:22:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never play\Nthe fake mysterious knight again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.06,0:22:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Me neither!\N- And I, instead, was wrong..
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.10,0:22:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,..not to believe the real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.62,0:22:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz,\Nwe would like to return this to you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.82,0:22:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, friends. I’m leaving it for you as\Nthank you for helping us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.90,0:22:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?! Such a beautiful sword?\N- It’s not possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.34,0:22:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though the witch is dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.06,0:22:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,another agent of Union X\Ncould attack us,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.46,0:22:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,so keep that one\Nfor safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.58,0:22:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- You might also need it.\N- Thank you, Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.26,0:22:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm keeping it! He gave it to me!\N- I stole it! It's mine! It's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.78,0:22:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.46,0:23:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting!\NYou must remain good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.70,0:23:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Good friends...!\N- But we love each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.66,0:23:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, from now on we will\Nfight together against the enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.66,0:23:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't ask for anything better.
